que 7-bedroom apartment located in Nine Lions, a sought-after and well-secured residential complex in Nueva Andalucía offering 53 apartments. Built to the highest standards, it is south facing and offers spectacular sea views. \n\nDistributed on one level, it comprise: entrance hall; living area with fireplace; dining area with an open-plan fully fitted kitchen with Gaggenau appliances; glassed-in terrace with a Napoleon summer kitchen and Jacuzzi; 7 bedrooms; 5 bathrooms; guest toilet. \nFeatures include: bathrooms by Villeroy and Boch, cinema room, laundry area and storage room. Lift from the garage directly to the apartment.\n\nGarage spaces for 3 cars and further storage. Offered fully furnished.\n\nThe complex boasts communal gardens, three heated pools (two outdoor- and ‌an ‌indoor ‌pool), ‌sauna, ‌a ‌fully fitted ‌gym and ‌club house, 24/7 security and ‌concierge ‌services.\n\nOnly ‌a ‌short ‌drive to all amenities, ‌the ‌beach, ‌Puerto ‌Banús ‌and ‌Marbella ‌centre."},"features":{"es":["Sur","Comunitaria","Cubierta","Con Calefacción","Chimenea","Terraza Cubierta","Ascensor","Armarios Empotrados","Terraza Privada","Gimnasio","Lavadero","Baño En-Suite","Amueblada","Parcialmente Equipada","Comunitario","Portero Automático","Seguridad 24 Horas","Más de uno","Privado","Teléfono","Lujo"],"en":["South","Communal","Indoor","Heated","Fireplace","Covered Terrace","Lift","Fitted Wardrobes","Private Terrace","Gym","Utility Room","Ensuite Bathroom","Fully Furnished","Partially Fitted","Communal","Entry Phone","24 Hour Security","More Than One","Private","Telephone","Luxury"]},"piscina":true,"parking":true,"jardin":true,"estado":"Available"}